  "problem": "Given that  $f(t)=\u27e8\\operatorname{sin}\u2061t,\\,\\operatorname{ln}\u2061(3t),\\,{t}^{3}\u27e9,$ what is ${f}^{\u2032}(t)?$\n\n${f}^{\u2032}(t)=\u27e8${{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}$,$\n{{field-3}}$\u27e9$",
